Am 14.07.2012 20:48, schrieb Terry Sofian:
> Has anyone ever done base 12 numbers for lojban? If so what are they?

Lojban has numbers up to base 16.
I'm sure you're familiar with the digits from 0 to 9. Next:
dau = A
fei = B
Those are enough to express any number in base 12.

li re re du li pa dau [ju'u pa re]
    12     =      1A    [base 12]

mu'o mi'e la selpa'i

